# CCCL → rocThrust Sync Investigation: <CURRENT_TAG> → <TO_TAG>

Step 0 pre-sync investigation. This report catalogs everything that changed in
the targeted CCCL release(s) so the rocThrust code sync can be planned
and scoped. It is descriptive intelligence — it does **not** port any code.
The sync itself is driven by `rocthrust-cccl-sync-todo` → `-resolve` →
`-finalize`; see Handoff below. (There is no `-tickets` skill yet; §5 is
forward-compatible scaffolding for one.)

